[1362.312,"o","ec.md for detailed project overview\u001b[29m\u001b(B\r\n     ☒ \u001b[9mExplore key directories and architecture\u001b[29m\r\n     \u001b[38;2;78;186;101m☒ \u001b[9mExamine shared types to understand data structures\u001b[39m\u001b[29m\r\n\r\n\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m⏺\u001b[39m \u001b[1mVibeTunnel Repository Overview\u001b[22m\r\n\r\n  \u001b[1mVibeTunnel\u001b[22m is a sophisticated terminal multiplexer that lets you access terminal sessions through any web browser. It's built as a three-part ecosystem:\r\n\r\n  \u001b[2mArchitecture\u001b[22m\r\n\r\n  - \u001b[1mmacOS Menu Bar App\u001b[22m (\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mmac/\u001b[39m): Native Swift/SwiftUI app that manages the server lifecycle\r\n  - \u001b[1miOS Companion\u001b[22m (\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mios/\u001b[39m): Mobile terminal client for on-the-go access\r\n  - \u001b[1mWeb Stack\u001b[22m (\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mweb/\u001b[39m): Node.js/Express server with LitElement frontend\r\n\r\n  \u001b[2mKey Features\u001b[22m\r\n\r\n  1. \u001b[1mTerminal Session Management\u001b[22m: Create, persist, and manage multiple terminal sessions\r\n  2. \u001b[1mReal-time Streaming\u001b[22m: Uses a custom binary protocol over WebSocket for efficient termi"]
[1362.317,"o","nal I/O\r\n  3. \u001b[1mRemote Access\u001b[22m: Built-in ngrok/Tailscale integration for secure remote connections\r\n  4. \u001b[1mSession Recording\u001b[22m: Records sessions in asciinema format for playback\r\n  5. \u001b[1mPush Notifications\u001b[22m: Web push API for session events (exit, errors, etc.)\r\n  6. \u001b[1mAdvanced Terminal Modes\u001b[22m: Dynamic title management with activity indicators\r\n\r\n  \u001b[2mTechnical Highlights\u001b[22m\r\n\r\n  - \u001b[1mBinary Buffer Protocol\u001b[22m: Custom format with magic bytes (0x5654 \"VT\") for viewport snapshots\r\n  - \u001b[1mDual Streaming\u001b[22m: SSE for asciinema cast streaming + WebSocket for binary buffers\r\n  - \u001b[1mPTY Management\u001b[22m: Uses node-pty with automatic shell alias resolution\r\n  - \u001b[1mActivity Monitoring\u001b[22m: 100ms precision tracking with filesystem-based persistence\r\n  - \u001b[1mHQ Mode\u001b[22m: Distributed architecture supporting multiple remote servers\r\n\r\n  \u001b[2mDevelopment\u001b[22m\r\n\r\n  - Web development uses \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mpnpm run dev\u001b[39m with hot reloading\r\n  - Code quality: \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mpnpm run chec"]
[1362.322,"o","k\u001b[39m (format, lint, typecheck)\r\n  - Testing: Vitest for unit tests, Playwright for E2E\r\n  - Native binary compilation for standalone deployment\r\n\r\n  The codebase demonstrates clean separation of concerns with modular services, comprehensive error handling, and a focus on performance optimization for real-time terminal\r\n  operations.\r\n\r\n\u001b[2m\u001b[38;2;136;136;136m╭─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮\u001b[39m\u001b[22m\r\n\u001b[2m\u001b[38;2;136;136;136m│\u001b[39m\u001b[22m > \u001b[7m \u001b[27m                                                             "]
